==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hófr|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|hōfaz|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{recons|ḱoph₂ós|lang=ine-pro}}. Compare Danish and Swedish {{term|hov|lang=sv}}, English {{term|hoof|lang=en}}, German {{term|Huf|lang=de}}, Dutch {{term|hoef|lang=nl}}.

